<title>NORWAY: SAS mulls disposal of Radisson hotel chain.</title>
<headline>SAS mulls disposal of Radisson hotel chain.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airlines System (SAS) said on Monday it was reviewing various options for its Radisson hotel business and had engaged an international investment bank to help in the evaluation.</p>
<p>&quot;In its long-term strategy to focus on its core business SAS constantly reviews various options for businesses within the group,&quot; SAS said in a statement to the Oslo bourse.</p>
<p>&quot;The hotel business is currently subject to such a review.&quot;</p>
</text>
